            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.22+2KI.25.23+2KI.25.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 25:22-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie kinde ma jego ceke mi njuru asikari ma ni i yamba, en e gin ku dhanu migi, giwinjo nia ubimo mi Babeli ketho Gedalia ma wod Ahikam ni jabim i ng’ombe, man eketho co, ku mon, ku nyithindho, man kind jucan ma dit m’i ng’ombe the cinge, kind ju ma juyaku jutero ni ng’eca ngo i Babeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gilund gibino ba Gedalia i Mizpa, gi eni, Icmael ma wod Nethania, man Yohanan ku Yonathan ma gi wot Kareya, man Seraya ma wod Tanhumeth, man wot Efai ma Janetofathi, man Yezania ma wod Jamakathi, gin ku dhanu migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Gedalia ma wod Ahikam ma wod Cafan, ukwong’o kwong’ igi man ni dhanu migi, ewacu kumae, Lworo timo ni Jukaldayo kud unegwu: wubed i ng’om, man wutim ni ubimo mi Babeli, e ebibedo ber iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi an, nen, abedo i Mizpa, kara acung i wang’ Jukaldayo ma bibino i bang’wa: ento wun, wucok pigulok ku nying’ piny mi cwir man mo, e wukethgi i agulu mu, man wubed i adhura mu ma wumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumeno kinde ma Juyahudi ceke ma gini i Moab, man i kind nyithindho mir Amon, man i Edom, man ma ni i ng’om ceke, giwinjo nia ubimo mi Babeli weko dong’ dhanu mi Yuda, man nia eketho Gedalia ma wod Ahikam, ma wod Cafan, i wigi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Juyahudi ceke gilund gidwogo kud i kaka ceke ma juriemogi i ie, e gibino i ng’om Yuda, ba Gedalia, i Mizpa, man gicoko pigulok ku nying’ piny mi cwir dit apila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke Yohanan ma wod Kareya, ku jego mi njuru asikari ceke ma ni i yamba, gibino ba Gedalia i Mizpa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e giwacu ire kumae, Ing’eyo nia Balis m’ubimo mi nyithindho mir Amon uoro Icmael ma wod Nethania unegi? Ento Gedalia ma wod Ahikam uyio igi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohanan ma wod Kareya lund uyero ni Gedalia i Mizpa mung’ mung’, ewacu kumae, Akwei, wek acidh aneg Icmael ma w’od Nethania, e ng’atu moko mbe ma bing’eyo maeni: pirang’o enegi, ketho Juyahudi ceke m’ucokri i kumi gilal, man dong Yuda rwinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Gedalia ma wod Ahikam uwacu ni Yohanan ma wod Kareya kumae, Kud itim gin maeni; kum iyero ndra pi Icmael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
